Add docs/scheme-architecture.md — the design for KittyTK Applications'
profile:// and box:// storage schemes: the URL grammar (meaning rides on the
authority slot), the Desktop-as-resolver/broker model, the two orthogonal
permission axes, canonical identity, and the multiuser cross-product left open
for later. Design-status; written down so the grammar and permission rules are
settled before code depends on them.

Also fix UTF-8 mojibake in sdl/sdl3/sdl3.go comments, where em-dashes had been
mangled to "â". Comment-only; no code change.

No build-counter bump: docs and comment cosmetics only, no behavioral change.
